{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"All of Japan―
{PAUSE ""}
No, ladies and gentlemen of the world, ladies and gentlemen of planet Earth, thank you for waiting!
{PAUSE ""}
　At last, at last, it is time for the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="たいしょくさい">Big Eating Festival</STYLE> 804 final!
{PAUSE ""}
　We are currently broadcasting the Tokyo night view live from 2,000 meters above Ikebukuro."<PG>
"The current temperature in Shibuya Ward is 21 degrees, with a 0% chance of rain and almost no wind. 
{PAUSE ""}
The Shibuya crossing, usually busy with crowds of people coming and going, is closed to traffic tonight for the ultimate showdown with the full cooperation of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police, and a special stage has been built!
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しんばし">Shinbashi</STYLE>-san at the venue, how are things over there?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\eventhall1.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\決勝会場.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Yes, this is Yukino <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しんばし">Shinbashi</STYLE> at the venue. 
{PAUSE ""}
Seats set out for three. 
{PAUSE ""}
A great many people have flocked here to witness the moment of the century. 
{PAUSE ""}
Champion Shinori Minamizaki, first in the qualifier, and <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya Niimura</STYLE>, in second, have both told us they are ready any time. 
{PAUSE ""}
However, one contestant has yet to arrive at the venue."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"If I recall correctly, she is on her way here from Sawa Prefecture. Will she make it in time?
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
　Ohh! What is that!?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
