{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"A helicopter is approaching us here on the aerial team!
{PAUSE ""}
　As if showing itself off, as if swallowing the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="たいしょくさい">Big Eating Festival</STYLE> 804 from the sky, a helicopter is passing in front of us and heading for Shibuya!
{PAUSE ""}
　Camera, close in on it!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\ヘリ上空2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\スカイダイビング4.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\スカイダイビング1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"A woman as small as a child! It's Silent Angel <STYLE ID="4">Erina Goto</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
　Incredibly, she has come all the way from Sawa Prefecture by helicopter to make it to the contest in time!
{PAUSE ""}
　However, there is no way to land a helicopter in the streets of Shibuya!
{PAUSE ""}
　How on earth is she going to―"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\スカイダイビング2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\スカイダイビング3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ohh! She has jumped!
{PAUSE ""}
　Together with an instructor wearing a parachute, she is skydiving straight to the venue!
{PAUSE ""}
　Why, why did the Tokyo Metropolitan Police allow this!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Truly, 
{PAUSE ""}
truly, <STYLE ID="4">Erina Goto</STYLE>, true to the name Silent Angel, is making her entrance from the sky like an angel!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\スカイダイビング.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{QUAKE "000,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
