{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\東京上空2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Below me, I could see the night view of Tokyo, the center of Japan, glittering in the night.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Falling at high speed―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Falling into a sea of light―<PG>
This skydive doesn't scare me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because if I don't do this, I won't make it in time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not making it in time and missing the final would be―scary.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Living those days on nothing but survival instinct again would be―scary.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\eventhall1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\スカイダイビングしたから.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ライブ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "T" "200" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"We can see it from down here too!
{PAUSE ""}
　One parachute floating in the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="こうこう">blazing</STYLE> lights of Tokyo!
{PAUSE ""}
　Could that be Silent Angel <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>!?
{PAUSE ""}
　The way she dances in the sky, she is truly an Angel, a heavenly angel!
{PAUSE ""}
　Any moment now, any moment now, she will arrive here at the Shibuya scramble crossing!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\決勝会場.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Silent Angel, <STYLE ID="4">Erina Goto</STYLE>, has just arrived at the venue!
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\大歓声.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
　The excitement here at the Shibuya crossing is incredible!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I bowed deeply to the frenzied crowd.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Applause and cheers, sent to me for my pointlessly flashy entrance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took them in with my whole body.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I was absolutely sure you'd come."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-san</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My smoldering fighting spirit began to simmer up again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then the champion, Minamizaki-san, walked up to me as well.<PG>
"Just as I thought, <STYLE ID="4">you're</STYLE> the grilled-squid girl I fought in Motoki-cho 4 years ago."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I remembered too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The eating contest held at the cherry-blossom festival 4 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That day, she and I had fought.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="4">Goto-san</STYLE>, if you'd gone all out at that contest, I'd have lost, 100%. 
{PAUSE ""}
So I kept waiting until today, believing I could fight <STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE> again. 
{PAUSE ""}
For these 4 years, I've kept defending my championship with only one goal: beating <STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I had that much potential.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then all I can do is fight, to answer that passion.<PG>
The three of us each had our own aims.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But only someone with not just passion but real ability as well can win this holy war.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now, on top of this huge crowd, a live nationwide broadcast. How far can I, now the most conspicuous person in Japan, really go?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "2000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "500" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"And now!
{PAUSE ""}
　The <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="たいしょくさい">Big Eating Festival</STYLE> 804, deciding the king of competitive eating for Shiyo 804, <TXSPS>is now ooooooopen!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\スイッチ大.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\決勝会場2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
