{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\大歓声.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>The heretical genre called competitive eating, which I had once given up on and despaired of.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Me, one of the stars of this event for gawking at oddballs.<PG>
And the champion, Minamizaki-san, and <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-san</STYLE> are, in the end, the same breed, exposed to curious stares.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For an event like this, the TV station spends a fortune, 
{PAUSE ""}
the local government wastes taxes, 
{PAUSE ""}
the Tokyo Metropolitan Police block the roads, 
{PAUSE ""}
and they even allow my skydiving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then the crowd gathered here.<PG>
Huh. Japan's nothing but idiots.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the star of those idiots is... me!<PG>
"And now! Contestants, please come up onto the stage!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\決勝会場3.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A stage built on the Shibuya scramble crossing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Three tables had been set out, and behind them was a painting with '食祝' written on it in huge letters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="・・・・・・">Shokushuku</STYLE>,' maybe? Is that how you read it? [TN: shokushuku = "eat" + "celebrate"; not a real word]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lavish, and yet somehow cheap...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, we ourselves are the star attraction, so I suppose fancy decorations aren't necessary?<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
"Now, without further ado, let me introduce the menu for the final!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When Announcer Shinbashi shouted that, the whole venue fell silent at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\トラック.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "3000" "PASS"}
At the same time, the loud rumble of an engine reached us.<PG>
