{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
When the truck stopped, its container was opened, and a crowd of staff were carrying something out from inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is that the menu for the final...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "Shadows_creeping.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\バイキング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム2,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What they were carrying out was a variety of dishes: pork cutlet, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="いた">stir-fried</STYLE> vegetables, hot pots, sashimi, pickles.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were lined up neatly, like a buffet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What kind of contest could this be?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Do we eat lots of whatever we like and compete on how much we eat?<PG>
"Now, 29 kinds of dishes have been set out on the special table!
{PAUSE ""}
　We will introduce the dishes laid out here in no particular order!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
1. Pork cutlet
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
